          'Option 2 — MBA after 2–3 years of work: CAT/XAT/GMAT → IIM/ISB/top B-schools. Investment: ₹15L–₹25L. Salary jump: 2x–4x. Best for graduates with clear management, consulting, or product goals.',
          'Option 3 — Government exams: UPSC, SSC, banking (IBPS, SBI), state PSCs, railway, defence. Salary: ₹6L–₹15 LPA + lifetime stability + pension. Best for graduates who value stability, work-life balance, and societal impact.',
